            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A landing gear assembly comprising a main strut having at least one pair of wheels mounted at a first end. Each pair of wheels is arranged to rotate about a wheel axis. The landing gear assembly also comprises a drag stay. A first end of the drag stay is attached to the main strut and a second end of the drag stay is for connecting to the fuselage of an aircraft. The landing gear assembly also comprises a landing gear main fitting for connecting the landing gear to the fuselage of an aircraft. The landing gear main fitting is attached to the main strut and defines a landing gear axis about which the main strut can rotate. The landing gear axis is neither perpendicular nor parallel with each wheel axis.</p>
            </abstract>
